      "start": "00:30:43,380",
      "end": "00:30:45,020",
      "text": "Thank you very much.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 319,
      "start": "00:30:46,300",
      "end": "00:30:49,420",
      "text": "Kris, I can enter the audition round.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 320,
      "start": "00:30:52,180",
      "end": "00:30:54,660",
      "text": "I made it. I got the main role.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 321,
      "start": "00:30:54,680",
      "end": "00:30:56,660",
      "text": "I believe that you could do that.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 322,
      "start": "00:31:03,080",
      "end": "00:31:04,860",
      "text": "Stop! What are you doing?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 323,
      "start": "00:31:05,260",
      "end": "00:31:06,500",
      "text": "We’re happy.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 324,
      "start": "00:31:06,540",
      "end": "00:31:08,400",
      "text": "We’re happy for Karn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 325,
      "start": "00:31:08,440",
      "end": "00:31:11,760",
      "text": "Excuse me? Flowers for Aonthakarn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 326,
      "start": "00:31:17,560",
      "end": "00:31:20,220",
      "text": "That's a really big bouquet of flowers.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 327,
      "start": "00:31:20,600",
      "end": "00:31:22,280",
      "text": "Who gave it to you?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 328,
      "start": "00:31:22,460",
      "end": "00:31:25,260",
      "text": "I saw it was from A.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 329,
      "start": "00:31:25,600",
      "end": "00:31:26,800",
      "text": "What is that?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 330,
      "start": "00:31:27,700",
      "end": "00:31:33,400",
      "text": "Someone close to me whose name starts with A can only be…",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 331,
      "start": "00:31:41,780",
      "end": "00:31:43,160",
      "text": "Who’s that, Karn?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 332,
      "start": "00:31:43,780",
      "end": "00:31:45,980",
      "text": "It’s probably be Apple.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 333,
      "start": "00:31:50,120",
      "end": "00:31:52,120",
      "text": "I don’t think so, Karn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 334,
      "start": "00:31:56,000",
      "end": "00:31:57,260",
      "text": "Get in the frame now.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 335,
      "start": "00:32:01,260",
      "end": "00:32:04,580",
      "text": "I can enter the audition round now.  Thank you everyone for supporting me.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 336,
      "start": "00:32:04,620",
      "end": "00:32:08,980",
      "text": "And thank you my important fan for a beautiful bouquet of flowers.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 337,
      "start": "00:32:09,000",
      "end": "00:32:10,980",
      "text": "I’ll do my best.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 338,
      "start": "00:32:11,980",
      "end": "00:32:13,000",
      "text": "Who the hell was that?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 339,
      "start": "00:32:24,660",
      "end": "00:32:25,860",
      "text": "Oh. Hi, Kris.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 340,
      "start": "00:32:27,660",
      "end": "00:32:29,000",
      "text": "Hello, Kris.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 341,
      "start": "00:32:33,000",
      "end": "00:32:35,880",
      "text": "Oh, there are the trainees.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 342,
      "start": "00:32:35,920",
      "end": "00:32:37,880",
      "text": "They’re doing an internship at our company.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 343,
      "start": "00:32:40,120",
      "end": "00:32:41,120",
      "text": "This is Earn. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 344,
      "start": "00:32:42,080",
      "end": "00:32:43,100",
      "text": "This is Case.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 345,
      "start": "00:32:46,840",
      "end": "00:32:50,060",
      "text": "Does our company accept trainees?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 346,
      "start": "00:32:50,080",
      "end": "00:32:52,280",
      "text": "Why are you saying that?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 347,
      "start": "00:32:52,600",
      "end": "00:32:54,660",
      "text": "You didn’t read the messages in the group line, do you?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 348,
      "start": "00:32:56,740",
      "end": "00:32:58,040",
      "text": "Do I look like I have a free time?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 349,
      "start": "00:32:58,060",
      "end": "00:32:59,880",
      "text": "You gave me a lot of work to do.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 350,
      "start": "00:33:00,820",
      "end": "00:33:02,820",
      "text": "How am I supposed to find time to do anything?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 351,
      "start": "00:33:02,840",
      "end": "00:33:03,640",
      "text": "You always find an excuse.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 352,
      "start": "00:33:03,680",
      "end": "00:33:05,300",
      "text": "I’m sorry, then.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 353,
      "start": "00:33:09,560",
      "end": "00:33:10,700",
      "text": "Hello.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 354,
      "start": "00:33:10,740",
      "end": "00:33:13,760",
      "text": "Hello. Trainees, right?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 355,
      "start": "00:33:16,040",
      "end": "00:33:18,100",
      "text": "How come do you know?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 356,
      "start": "00:33:19,160",
      "end": "00:33:21,740",
      "text": "They talked about it in the group line, Kris.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 357,
      "start": "00:33:21,760",
      "end": "00:33:22,660",
      "text": "See?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 358,
      "start": "00:33:26,400",
      "end": "00:33:29,660",
      "text": "There, there. It’s alright.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 359,
      "start": "00:33:31,960",
      "end": "00:33:34,100",
      "text": "Karn, don’t pamper her too much. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 360,
      "start": "00:33:34,120",
      "end": "00:33:34,980",
      "text": "She will be spoiled.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 361,
      "start": "00:33:35,020",
      "end": "00:33:35,880",
      "text": "It’s none of your business.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 362,
      "start": "00:33:36,740",
      "end": "00:33:40,340",
      "text": "Kris, you look cool but also have a cute side.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 363,
      "start": "00:33:41,780",
      "end": "00:33:43,260",
      "text": "Thank you, ma’am.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 364,
      "start": "00:33:43,480",
      "end": "00:33:46,100",
      "text": "You don’t have to be too polite with me.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 365,
      "start": "00:33:46,140",
      "end": "00:33:49,540",
      "text": "We’re going to be colleagues soon. You can call me Earn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 366,
      "start": "00:33:50,780",
      "end": "00:33:55,440",
      "text": "Okay, earn. You can call me Sis.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 367,
      "start": "00:33:55,840",
      "end": "00:33:58,180",
      "text": "Since we’re going to be close.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 368,
      "start": "00:33:58,880",
      "end": "00:34:02,140",
      "text": "Are you two dating?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 369,
      "start": "00:34:03,660",
      "end": "00:34:05,120",
      "text": "We’re best friends.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 370,
      "start": "00:34:06,240",
      "end": "00:34:07,080",
      "text": "Really?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 371,
      "start": "00:34:30,780",
      "end": "00:34:31,640",
      "text": "Karn",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 372,
      "start": "00:34:34,660",
      "end": "00:34:35,540",
      "text": "What?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 373,
      "start": "00:34:37,140",
      "end": "00:34:38,300",
      "text": "Are you sulky?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 374,
      "start": "00:34:40,420",
      "end": "00:34:41,100",
      "text": "No.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 375,
      "start": "00:34:46,600",
      "end": "00:34:48,740",
      "text": "This is called very sulky.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 376,
      "start": "00:34:53,260",
      "end": "00:34:54,740",
      "text": "Are you jealous of me?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 377,
      "start": "00:34:57,280",
      "end": "00:34:58,080",
      "text": "Umm.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 378,
      "start": "00:34:59,200",
      "end": "00:35:01,480",
      "text": "I just met Earn today.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 379,
      "start": "00:35:01,500",
      "end": "00:35:03,480",
      "text": "How could there be something?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 380,
      "start": "00:35:04,580",
      "end": "00:35:06,820",
      "text": "It’s not about that.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 381,
      "start": "00:35:08,360",
      "end": "00:35:10,660",
      "text": "When she asked if we were dating,",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 382,
      "start": "00:35:11,400",
      "end": "00:35:13,400",
      "text": "why did you say we were just friends.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 383,
      "start": "00:35:15,040",
      "end": "00:35:16,700",
      "text": "Oh, Karn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 384,
      "start": "00:35:19,780",
      "end": "00:35:21,780",
      "text": "You looks very scared.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 385,
      "start": "00:35:23,600",
      "end": "00:35:25,280",
      "text": "Don’t you feel scared?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 386,
      "start": "00:35:26,300",
      "end": "00:35:29,100",
      "text": "With someone close to us, I understand. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 387,
      "start": "00:35:29,460",
      "end": "00:35:31,100",
      "text": "But she’s a stranger. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 388,
      "start": "00:35:32,280",
      "end": "00:35:35,460",
      "text": " And you’re going to act in a series.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 389,
      "start": "00:35:36,300",
      "end": "00:35:39,000",
      "text": "If she talks about you in a bad way, what will you do?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 390,
      "start": "00:35:39,500",
      "end": "00:35:41,580",
      "text": "Why do you always think for me?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 391,
      "start": "00:35:43,580",
      "end": "00:35:45,580",
      "text": "Because I’m worried about you.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 392,
      "start": "00:35:52,180",
      "end": "00:35:53,660",
      "text": "Do you feel offended?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 393,
      "start": "00:35:56,540",
      "end": "00:35:58,540",
      "text": "I just don’t get it.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 394,
      "start": "00:35:58,560",
      "end": "00:36:00,920",
      "text": "You make it seem like our thing is embarrassing.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 395,
      "start": "00:36:02,560",
      "end": "00:36:04,560",
      "text": "I never thought like that.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 396,
      "start": "00:36:05,980",
      "end": "00:36:09,720",
      "text": "I didn’t tell her because… You know it well. Because it’s…",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 397,
      "start": "00:36:09,740",
      "end": "00:36:11,720",
      "text": "Ouch! Darling, please be gentle.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 398,
      "start": "00:36:11,740",
      "end": "00:36:15,180",
      "text": "Oh, I miss you so much, baby.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 399,
      "start": "00:36:37,560",
      "end": "00:36:42,520",
      "text": "We should tell everyone that we’re dating.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 400,
      "start": "00:36:43,040",
      "end": "00:36:44,060",
      "text": "Baby?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 401,
      "start": "00:36:45,240",
      "end": "00:36:49,740",
      "text": "Kris is so fussy. I’ll tell her later.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 402,
      "start": "00:36:49,780",
      "end": "00:36:53,260",
      "text": "When are you going to tell everyone about us?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 403,
      "start": "00:36:53,620",
      "end": "00:36:55,780",
      "text": "Damn, Pud.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 404,
      "start": "00:36:55,940",
      "end": "00:36:57,640",
      "text": " Why does it have to be here?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 405,
      "start": "00:38:09,780",
      "end": "00:38:11,240",
      "text": "What does Aonthakarn mean?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 406,
      "start": "00:38:11,820",
      "end": "00:38:14,180",
      "text": "It means darkness.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 407,
      "start": "00:38:21,580",
      "end": "00:38:22,960",
      "text": "Wrong answer.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 408,
      "start": "00:38:23,680",
      "end": "00:38:29,020",
      "text": "Aonthakarn means lovely.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 409,
      "start": "00:38:30,740",
      "end": "00:38:31,500",
      "text": "Yuck! ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 410,
      "start": "00:38:32,880",
      "end": "00:38:33,940",
      "text": "Same old trick.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 411,
      "start": "00:38:35,220",
      "end": "00:38:36,440",
      "text": "Still sulky?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 412,
      "start": "00:38:38,440",
      "end": "00:38:39,600",
      "text": "I saw you secretly smiling.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 413,
      "start": "00:38:40,460",
      "end": "00:38:41,960",
      "text": "The corner of your mouth is twitching now.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 414,
      "start": "00:38:43,640",
      "end": "00:38:45,600",
      "text": "Don’t be sulky. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 415,
      "start": "00:38:45,640",
      "end": "00:38:47,420",
      "text": "Please, Aonthakarn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 416,
      "start": "00:38:57,720",
      "end": "00:38:58,700",
      "text": "You want more?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 417,
      "start": "00:39:00,280",
      "end": "00:39:01,380",
      "text": "Are you still sulky?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 418,
      "start": "00:39:01,900",
      "end": "00:39:02,680",
      "text": "You’re not sulky now?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 419,
      "start": "00:39:03,960",
      "end": "00:39:06,920",
      "text": "Oh, why is it so hard for you to stop being sulky? ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 420,
      "start": "00:39:07,220",
      "end": "00:39:08,420",
      "text": " Why is it so hard for you to stop being sulky.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 421,
      "start": "00:39:08,780",
      "end": "00:39:09,660",
      "text": "You’re not sulky now, ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 422,
      "start": "00:39:10,520",
      "end": "00:39:11,780",
      "text": " are you? Hmm?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 423,
      "start": "00:39:13,940",
      "end": "00:39:15,420",
      "text": "Okay, I’m not sulky now.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 424,
      "start": "00:39:16,140",
      "end": "00:39:19,440",
      "text": "You know well that I still stop being sulky if you do this.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 425,
      "start": "00:39:19,980",
      "end": "00:39:23,220",
      "text": "Because I am your girlfriend. How could I not know that?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 426,
      "start": "00:39:27,960",
      "end": "00:39:30,340",
      "text": "Sorry for being silly.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 427,
      "start": "00:39:31,660",
      "end": "00:39:33,400",
      "text": "I’m sorry, too. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 428,
      "start": "00:39:35,840",
      "end": "00:39:39,060",
      "text": "Sorry for being a bad girlfriend.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 429,
      "start": "00:39:41,060",
      "end": "00:39:43,140",
      "text": "I understand that you’re worried about me.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 430,
      "start": "00:39:44,420",
      "end": "00:39:46,420",
      "text": "I understand your reason, too.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 431,
      "start": "00:39:48,780",
      "end": "00:39:50,960",
      "text": "I just feel bad.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 432,
      "start": "00:39:52,620",
      "end": "00:39:53,960",
      "text": "I get it now, Karn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 433,
      "start": "00:39:55,080",
      "end": "00:39:59,320",
      "text": "Then, if you ‘re okay with it, ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 434,
      "start": "00:40:00,400",
      "end": "00:40:01,740",
      "text": " I won’t keep it a secret anymore.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 435,
      "start": "00:40:04,740",
      "end": "00:40:06,520",
      "text": "But I won’t announce it. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 436,
      "start": "00:40:08,000",
      "end": "00:40:09,780",
      "text": " If anyone knows, it’s fine.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 437,
      "start": "00:40:10,940",
      "end": "00:40:16,760",
      "text": "If anyone asks me, I’ll say that we’re dating.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 438,
      "start": "00:40:19,120",
      "end": "00:40:19,880",
      "text": "Umm.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 439,
      "start": "00:40:21,040",
      "end": "00:40:23,460",
      "text": "Sorry for being a bad girlfriend.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 440,
      "start": "00:40:27,660",
      "end": "00:40:31,640",
      "text": "You’re always the best for me.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 441,
      "start": "00:40:32,840",
      "end": "00:40:35,000",
      "text": "My cheeks are all puffy now.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 442,
      "start": "00:40:41,180",
      "end": "00:40:42,540",
      "text": "But, Kris,",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 443,
      "start": "00:40:44,680",
      "end": "00:40:47,640",
      "text": "your brother is very naughty.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 444,
      "start": "00:40:47,680",
      "end": "00:40:51,180",
      "text": "What are you talking about?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 445,
      "start": "00:40:51,220",
      "end": "00:40:52,280",
      "text": "I almost forgot it. The image is stuck in my mind.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 446,
      "start": "00:40:52,320",
      "end": "00:40:55,620",
      "text": "I always thought that Pud is strong. But being able to easily carry Earn like that…",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 447,
      "start": "00:40:55,660",
      "end": "00:40:57,400",
      "text": "Enough! Now, naughty girl.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 448,
      "start": "00:40:57,440",
      "end": "00:40:58,960",
      "text": "He carried Earn.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 449,
      "start": "00:40:59,740",
      "end": "00:41:00,640",
      "text": "Enough!",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 450,
      "start": "00:41:01,380",
      "end": "00:41:02,460",
      "text": " Now! I am strong, too.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 451,
      "start": "00:41:05,320",
      "end": "00:41:09,680",
      "text": "Do you want to prove that I am just as hot?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 452,
      "start": "00:41:26,060",
      "end": "00:41:27,680",
      "text": "But we’re at work.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 453,
      "start": "00:41:32,640",
      "end": "00:41:36,300",
      "text": "I don’t see anyone else. It’s just the two of us.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 454,
      "start": "00:42:15,000",
      "end": "00:42:23,280",
      "text": "“I surrender, and I’ll follow only you ‘coz I love you. ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 455,
      "start": "00:42:23,320",
      "end": "00:42:32,360",
      "text": "Even though my heart is broken, I just wish you all the best and all those great things you wish for.",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 456,
      "start": "00:42:32,400",
      "end": "00:42:40,340",
      "text": "I wanna be that person of your dream, get close to you,",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 457,
      "start": "00:42:40,380",
      "end": "00:42:42,660",
      "text": "ขอให้เดินเคียงข้างกันไป",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 458,
      "start": "00:42:42,700",
      "end": "00:42:49,660",
      "text": "and stay with you all the way. If our feelings are mutual, could I be your boo? ",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 459,
      "start": "00:42:53,020",
      "end": "00:42:56,960",
      "text": " Could I be your boo?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    },
    {
      "index": 460,
      "start": "00:43:01,540",
      "end": "00:43:07,120",
      "text": " Could I be your boo?",
      "speaker": "[REVISAR]"
    }
  ],
